&lt;h3&gt;About Zuora&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Zuora, we help businesses grow smarter and adapt faster. Our platform powers modern business models — from subscriptions and usage-based pricing to AI-driven and outcome-based offerings — helping companies launch new products, automate complex billing, and unlock predictable, recurring revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve led the Subscription Economy for more than a decade. Now we’re evolving again by building the definitive platform for quote to cash and helping companies monetize their products and services with an adaptable, AI-ready foundation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zuora is the leader in monetization for subscription and usage-based businesses. On our strategic customer team, Solutions Engineers partner with Account Executives to &lt;strong&gt;win technical decisions&lt;/strong&gt; on enterprise deals — and stay close to customers after the sale for adoption and expansion.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is a &lt;strong&gt;hands-on&lt;/strong&gt; role: you’ll design, build and demo solutions, run POCs when the deal requires it (APIs, data, integrations), and remain close to customers post sale in a strategic capacity.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with AEs on enterprise sales cycles: discovery, solution design, demos, and technical wins&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scope &lt;strong&gt;quote-to-cash&lt;/strong&gt; solutions across billing, CPQ, and revenue — including subscription and &lt;strong&gt;usage-based&lt;/strong&gt; pricing where relevant&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build tailored demos and proofs of concept aligned to customer requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present to technical and business stakeholders, including senior leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support technical health on assigned accounts and surface expansion opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
