&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a skilled and customer-focused IT Support Specialist to join our team in Foster City, CA. The ideal candidate will provide exceptional technical support to both users in the office and remotely. This role requires a combination of technical expertise, strong communication skills, and a proactive approach to problem-solving. We are continually driving the implementation of new technologies to bring our work environment to the future, which requires a team ready to take on new challenges. Be a part of a growing company poised for growth and an energetic, engaging team!&lt;/p&gt;
