&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of managing and optimizing campaigns across LinkedIn Ads, Google Ads, and other B2B platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with marketing analytics tools (Google Analytics, LinkedIn Campaign Manager, Google Ads).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of B2B SaaS funnel dynamics, attribution, conversion optimization, audience strategy, and budget allocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project management skills and the ability to manage multiple campaigns, stakeholders, priorities, and deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven approach with strong analytical and problem-solving abilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
