&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Generous, flexible time off&lt;/strong&gt;, plus paid holidays, wellness days, and a &lt;strong&gt;company-wide year-end break&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid parental leave&lt;/strong&gt; (including fully paid leave for eligible ZEOs, subject to local policy)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; development stipend&lt;/strong&gt; to support ongoing growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Opportunities to volunteer and give back&lt;/strong&gt;, including charitable donation matching where available&lt;/li&gt;
