&lt;p&gt;The Integration Hub team is responsible for enabling:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pre-built and extensible connectors to third-party systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Event streaming and webhook frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scalable APIs and integration services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Secure, reliable, and observable data exchange across platforms&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are investing in a next-generation integration platform built on microservices, cloud-native architecture, and event-driven design principles to power Zuora’s ecosystem strategy for years to come.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Tech Stack includes:&lt;br&gt;Java, Spring Boot, REST APIs, Microservices, Kafka, AWS, Kubernetes, Terraform, Postgres, and distributed event-driven systems.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
