&lt;h3&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Senior Director of Engineering to lead the teams building and operating our payments platform. You&#39;ll shape technical strategy, strengthen engineering execution, and develop an organization that delivers reliable, scalable payment experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role requires a leader who combines technical depth with strong organizational leadership: someone who raises the bar for system performance, software quality, and operational discipline while helping teams move faster through effective use of AI tooling. Payment experience is a plus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you&#39;ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead for performance, scale, and resilience. Define the architecture and technical roadmap for a payments platform that supports growing transaction volumes, delivers low latency, and remains reliable through traffic spikes and downstream failures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise engineering and operational standards. Establish strong practices for system design, code quality, testing, observability, incident response, and continuous improvement. Build consistent approaches to integrating and operating across multiple payment gateways, including failure isolation, safe retries, and recovery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve engineering productivity with AI. Accelerate the adoption of AI tools across development, testing, code review, and troubleshooting. Measure their impact on delivery speed and quality, and establish practices that preserve security and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner across the business. Work closely with Product, Cloud Engineering, Security and gateway partners to deliver the business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About You&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You bring:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading multiple engineering teams and managers, with responsibility for technical strategy, organizational health, and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of building and operating high-throughput, highly available distributed systems, with demonstrated improvements in performance, scalability, and resilience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical judgment and the ability to engage deeply in architecture, design, and code quality while empowering teams to make decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience establishing engineering and operational excellence across complex systems and third-party integrations, including clear service objectives, effective incident management, and measurable reliability improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience improving engineering productivity through AI tooling with an emphasis on measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success recruiting, retaining, and developing engineers and managers, setting ambitious but achievable goals, and addressing performance gaps directly and constructively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and cross-functional leadership skills, including the ability to explain technical tradeoffs and connect engineering decisions to business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preferred experience:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Payments experience spanning gateways, processors, orchestration, authorization, settlement, reconciliation, or payment risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with financial transaction correctness, idempotency, payment security, and PCI compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deep payments expertise is welcome, but not required. We value leaders who have built reliable systems, developed strong teams, and can learn a complex domain quickly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the Team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll lead multiple engineering teams and managers responsible for the full lifecycle of our payments platform—from system architecture and gateway integration to operational reliability and continuous improvement. The organization combines deep technical expertise with strong execution discipline. Success in this role means building leadership capacity across the team, translating business priorities into measurable engineering outcomes, and establishing clear ownership and accountability for delivery, quality, and reliability. You&#39;ll work in close partnership with Product, Cloud Engineering, and Security to ensure the platform meets business needs while maintaining the highest standards for performance, availability, and security.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
