&lt;h3&gt;About the Team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Payroll Specialist plays a critical role in ensuring the seamless processing of the US payroll. This position requires a detail-oriented professional with deep expertise in payroll compliance, general ledger functions, and some international payroll operations. Working independently with minimal supervision, you will be responsible for ensuring payroll accuracy, compliance, and efficiency in a high-growth, fast-paced environment. As a key member of the US Payroll team, you will collaborate with finance, HR, and payroll service providers to enhance payroll processes and ensure timely and compliant payroll execution.&lt;/p&gt;
