&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Zuora&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zuora is entering a new chapter in its evolution, with an opportunity to rethink how an established enterprise software company builds, delivers, and operates technology in an AI-native world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As AI and agentic technologies reshape enterprise software, we believe the opportunity extends well beyond adding AI capabilities to existing products. It requires rethinking the underlying platforms, architecture, data foundations, and technical capabilities that enable intelligent systems to understand context, reason, take action, and deliver business outcomes. Zuora is investing in this transformation with the ambition to build a more intelligent, connected, and adaptable technology platform—one that accelerates product innovation, creates new customer value, and enables the company to operate with greater speed and efficiency. We are looking for a VP of Product for AI Platform to help define and build that foundation. This leader will bring together deep technical expertise, platform strategy, and an entrepreneurial mindset to establish the capabilities that make AI-native product experiences possible across Zuora.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The VP of Product for AI Platform will define and lead the strategy, architecture, and development of the shared AI platform capabilities that underpin Zuora’s next generation of products and experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not simply a role focused on integrating large language models or deploying AI infrastructure. It is an opportunity to determine what the company needs to build, what it should leverage from the rapidly evolving AI ecosystem, and how to create a scalable platform that enables product teams to innovate quickly without fragmenting the architecture or duplicating foundational capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate will work across Product, Engineering, Data, Security, and other technology leaders to establish the platform required to support AI-powered workflows, intelligent automation, and agentic experiences. They will translate an ambitious AI-native vision into a practical technical strategy, making thoughtful choices about architecture, investment, build-versus-buy decisions, and the capabilities that will differentiate Zuora. The mandate is both strategic and hands-on: establish the direction, build the foundational capabilities, and help the organization move from experimentation to production at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role &amp;amp; Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define the AI Platform Strategy and Architecture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop the vision, strategy, and technical architecture for Zuora’s AI platform, aligned with the company’s broader AI-native transformation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Determine the foundational capabilities required to support AI-powered products, intelligent workflows, and agentic applications across the portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish a coherent platform architecture that enables reuse, interoperability, extensibility, and rapid innovation across product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make pragmatic build-versus-buy decisions, leveraging external models, services, and infrastructure where appropriate while investing in capabilities that create strategic differentiation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish a roadmap that balances near-term product opportunities with the long-term platform capabilities required to support the company’s evolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the Foundations for AI-Native Products&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop shared capabilities that enable product teams to incorporate AI into customer experiences and business workflows without rebuilding foundational infrastructure for each use case.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish the technical foundations for AI agents that can understand user intent, access relevant context, reason through tasks, interact with enterprise systems, and take appropriate action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define approaches to model integration and orchestration, context management, retrieval-augmented generation, tool use, and agent execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable secure and reliable access to enterprise data, business logic, APIs, and transactional capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop reusable patterns and services that accelerate experimentation and reduce the time required to move AI capabilities from prototype to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the platform supports both conventional AI-enabled experiences and more autonomous, multi-step agentic workflows as the technology matures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Establish Enterprise-Grade AI Infrastructure and Governance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a secure, reliable, and scalable platform that meets the requirements of enterprise customers and mission-critical business workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish standards for model evaluation, testing, observability, performance, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop approaches to managing AI quality, latency, availability, and cost, including appropriate model selection and routing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Security, Legal, Privacy, and Compliance teams to establish appropriate controls for data access, model usage, agent permissions, and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure that AI systems operate within defined authorization boundaries, with appropriate safeguards, traceability, and human oversight for consequential actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish mechanisms to monitor production performance, identify failures, evaluate outcomes, and improve system behavior over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Technical and Business Outcomes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate platform investments into measurable business and customer outcomes, including faster product development, improved customer experiences, increased automation, and more efficient operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear measures of platform adoption, developer productivity, reliability, AI quality, cost efficiency, and time to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritize platform investments based on business impact and the capabilities they unlock for multiple product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the platform evolves in response to advances in AI technology, emerging customer needs, and lessons from production deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate architectural decisions, investment priorities, trade-offs, and progress clearly to executive leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The VP of Product for AI Platform will be successful when Zuora has established a coherent, secure, and scalable AI foundation that materially accelerates the company’s transition to AI-native products and operating models. Success will be reflected in:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Faster innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Product teams can develop, test, and deploy AI-powered capabilities without repeatedly building foundational infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production-grade AI:&lt;/strong&gt; AI applications operate with appropriate levels of reliability, quality, security, observability, and cost control.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agentic capabilities:&lt;/strong&gt; Zuora can build experiences that move beyond answering questions to executing meaningful business workflows within defined permissions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform adoption:&lt;/strong&gt; Shared AI capabilities are used across product teams, reducing duplication and accelerating delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer and business value:&lt;/strong&gt; Platform investments translate into more useful products, greater automation, and measurable improvements in customer and employee outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A scalable technical foundation:&lt;/strong&gt; The architecture can evolve as models, agent frameworks, and AI infrastructure continue to change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organizational alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Product, Engineering, Data, and Security teams operate with a shared understanding of the platform strategy and how to build on it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a technology leader who can build the AI platform that makes Zuora’s transformation real, turning rapidly evolving AI capabilities into secure, reusable, enterprise-grade foundations that enable our products to understand intent, execute workflows, and deliver business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep Technical and Architectural Expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven technology leader with significant experience building and scaling platforms, infrastructure, or distributed systems in complex enterprise software environments. Strong understanding of modern AI architectures and the infrastructure required to support production-grade AI applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with large language models, model serving and orchestration, retrieval-augmented generation, embeddings, vector search, context engineering, and agentic application architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing systems that integrate AI capabilities with enterprise data, APIs, business logic, and transactional systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong grounding in cloud architecture, distributed systems, security, reliability, and scalable software engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to distinguish durable architectural principles from capabilities that are changing rapidly as AI technology evolves.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An AI-Native Platform Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understands that AI-native software requires more than adding a model or conversational interface to an existing application.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thinks in terms of reusable capabilities, intelligent workflows, agents, orchestration, and systems that can act on behalf of users within defined boundaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can identify which capabilities should be foundational platform services and which should remain specific to individual products or use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understands the importance of context, permissions, data access, evaluation, observability, and reliability when moving AI from demonstrations into real enterprise workflows. Maintains a practical perspective on the limitations of current AI systems and knows how to build architectures that accommodate rapid technological change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Builder Who Can Turn Strategy into Reality&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has taken complex technical initiatives from initial concept through architecture, development, production deployment, and scaled adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Combines strategic thinking with the ability to engage deeply in technical decisions and challenge assumptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Makes clear trade-offs between speed, flexibility, cost, reliability, and long-term architectural integrity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knows when to build, when to buy, when to partner, and when to wait for the technology to mature.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is comfortable operating in an environment where the destination is clear but the technical and organizational path must be discovered and refined.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong Product and Business Orientation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understands that the purpose of a platform is not to build technology for its own sake, but to enable better products and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can connect platform architecture and investment decisions to customer value, product differentiation, developer productivity, and commercial impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Works effectively with senior Product and Engineering leaders to identify the highest-value opportunities for AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritizes simplicity, reuse, and adoption rather than building unnecessarily sophisticated infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uses measurable outcomes to evaluate whether platform investments are delivering value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Judgment and Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has experience building technology that must meet demanding requirements for security, privacy, reliability, and enterprise-scale operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can establish standards and governance without creating unnecessary bureaucracy or slowing innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicates complex technical concepts clearly to technical teams, product leaders, and executive stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influences across organizational boundaries and builds alignment around architecture, priorities, and shared ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attracts strong technical talent and creates an environment where high-performing engineers can do their best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfortable Defining What Comes Next&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is intellectually curious, adaptable, and energized by the pace of change in AI. Does not assume that established software architecture or organizational models will remain sufficient as AI capabilities evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can separate genuine technical opportunities from hype and make sound decisions amid uncertainty.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brings the judgment to establish a clear direction without pretending that every answer is already known.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is motivated by the opportunity to help define the next generation of enterprise software platforms rather than simply operate an established one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enable Product and Engineering Transformation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product and Engineering leadership to identify where shared AI platform capabilities can unlock meaningful customer value and accelerate product innovation. Help product teams rethink what becomes possible when AI can interpret intent and execute workflows rather than simply respond to user commands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear platform interfaces, development patterns, documentation, and tools that make AI capabilities accessible to product engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reduce duplicated infrastructure, fragmented implementations, and unnecessary complexity across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help define the operating model for how platform engineering, AI research and application development, product management, and data teams work together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of rapid experimentation, disciplined engineering, and learning from production outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and Lead a High-Impact Organization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a high-caliber AI platform organization that combines technical depth, strong engineering judgment, and an outcome-oriented mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attract and retain talent across AI infrastructure, platform engineering, distributed systems, and applied AI, as appropriate to the evolving mandate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish a culture of ownership, technical excellence, accountability, and pragmatic execution. Create an environment in which teams can move quickly while maintaining the reliability, security, and discipline required for enterprise software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop strong partnerships across the company, influencing through technical credibility and a clear articulation of platform value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zuora offers a comprehensive total rewards package designed to support ZEOs’ wellbeing, growth, and flexibility. While specific offerings may vary by country, we typically provide:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation, variable bonus and performance-based reward opportunities, and retirement programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical, dental, and vision insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous, flexible time off, plus paid holidays, wellness days, and a company-wide year-end break&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave (including fully paid leave for eligible ZEOs, subject to local policy)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning &amp;amp; development stipend to support ongoing growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunities to volunteer and give back, including charitable donation matching where available&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental wellbeing resources and support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;*Benefits may vary by location; details will be shared during the interview process&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#ZEOLife at Zuora&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;ZEOs (our employees) are empowered to take ownership, challenge the status quo, and make a real impact. We:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate deeply across teams and regions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn constantly and iterate often&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build an inclusive, high-performance culture where people feel inspired, connected, and valued&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to an Inclusive Workplace&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Think, be and do you.&lt;br&gt;At Zuora, different perspectives, experiences, and contributions matter — everyone counts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zuora is proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer committed to creating an inclusive environment for all. We do not discriminate on the basis of, and consider individuals seeking employment with Zuora without regard to, race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, reproductive health decisions, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, genetic information, political views or activity, or other applicable legally protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We encourage candidates from all backgrounds to apply. Applicants in need of special assistance or accommodation during the interview process or in accessing our website may contact us by sending an email to &lt;strong&gt;assistance@zuora.com&lt;/strong&gt; (or local equivalent, where applicable).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The base pay details represent the annualized salary range for the posted position. While we share a comprehensive range, a candidate’s final base salary will fall within these guidelines and will be determined based on multiple factors including but not limited to: qualifications of the candidate, job related knowledge, prior related experience, specific and unique skills, the location of the role, internal equity and internal budget. Base pay is only one element of Zuora’s Total Rewards Package. Additional elements may also include bonus/variable compensation, equity and comprehensive benefits, more details found &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.zuora.com/careers-life/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Pay Details&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$271,200&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$406,800 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;About Zuora&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Zuora, we help businesses grow smarter and adapt faster. Our platform powers modern business models — from subscriptions and usage-based pricing to AI-driven and outcome-based offerings — helping companies launch new products, automate complex billing, and unlock predictable, recurring revenue.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve led the Subscription Economy for more than a decade. Now we’re evolving again by building the definitive platform for quote to cash and helping companies monetize their products and services with an adaptable, AI-ready foundation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our Web Strategy Specialist, you will be the point of contact for everything web. You will own the website roadmap, decide what gets built and in what order, and make sure the pages our teams need go live quickly and to a high standard. You are obsessed with web experience and data, and you make decisions based on evidence, not opinion or the loudest request. You will give the web development team a clear, prioritized plan to build against.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Website Strategy &amp;amp; Roadmap&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the strategic roadmap for the Zuora website. Prioritize by business impact and pipeline contribution rather than reactive requests, and defend the roadmap against ad hoc, out-of-cycle asks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the single point of contact for all web needs across the company, and run a clear intake, prioritization and launch process that gets pages live predictably for every team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resolve competing priorities at the roadmap level, and communicate trade-offs openly to stakeholders at every level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business goals into clear briefs and execution plans for Design and Development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage multiple concurrent projects (campaign pages, redesigns, migrations, template builds) across Campaigns, Design, Development, Analytics and Product Marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance, Conversion &amp;amp; Experimentation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the KPIs that matter (conversion rate, engagement, form completion, pipeline contribution) and keep them visible to the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Find friction and opportunity across the user journey, and make sure visitors can find what they need and take the next step.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run an ongoing testing and optimization program using A/B tests, behavioral data and session analysis to improve outcomes, not just report on them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve page speed, accessibility and form experience across key page types.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personalization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and direct the strategy for using behavioral and account-level data (Demandbase, Amplitude and other sources) to serve tailored content and experiences to priority segments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the audiences, rules, content variants and success metrics, and work with Campaigns and ABM teams to put them into practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical SEO &amp;amp; Discoverability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own technical SEO implementation on the site: crawlability, indexing, site architecture, internal linking, structured data, redirects, Core Web Vitals and international setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the SEO &amp;amp; AEO lead so that page templates, components and rendering support both traditional search and AI answer engines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytics &amp;amp; Data Integrity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Analytics to make sure tracking, tagging and metrics are accurate and trustworthy across GA4, Amplitude and Looker Studio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain dashboards that give stakeholders a clear view of site performance, and turn the data into specific recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flag it when a number can’t be trusted, and drive the fix.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Direction &amp;amp; WordPress Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide the web development team’s priorities and technical approach on WordPress, including templates, reusable components and governance for how pages are built.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make sure the platform stays scalable, performant and easy for non-technical teams to use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global, Security &amp;amp; Brand Standards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set direction for multi-language support, international SEO and region-specific experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make sure the website meets required security, privacy and compliance standards, including consent and data handling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Brand and Design so the site reflects Zuora’s positioning and visual identity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About You&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You start with the business outcome and the user, then work backward to the plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable owning the details while keeping the larger roadmap in view.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring structure to ambiguous, competing requests and say no clearly when something doesn’t earn its place.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You make decisions with data and are honest about what the data does and doesn’t show.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You collaborate easily with Campaigns, Design, Development, Analytics and Sales, and you earn trust with senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You hold a high bar for quality, speed and accessibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6-8 years in a digital or web role, including 3+ years owning a corporate website or digital product, preferably in B2B SaaS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency with GA4, Amplitude, Looker Studio and Demandbase.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of leading a website redesign, platform migration or comparable large-scale initiative end to end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience setting priorities for and directing web development teams, translating business goals into clear technical plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience improving conversion through CRO and A/B testing, with examples of measurable lifts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of technical SEO (indexing, crawlability, structured data, Core Web Vitals) and how to implement it on a live site.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing or running personalization based on behavioral and account data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with senior stakeholders across Marketing, Product and Sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical, communication and prioritization skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise with WordPress (required), including how templates, components and publishing workflows are structured.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with experimentation platforms such as Optimizely or Amplitude Experiment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AEO/GEO and how site structure affects AI search visibility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing multi-language and multi-region sites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of HTML, CSS and JavaScript, and tag management (GTM).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with web privacy and compliance requirements (GDPR, CCPA, consent management).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience at a company selling billing, pricing or financial software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the Team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our website is often the first real conversation a buyer has with Zuora, and increasingly it is read by AI engines before it is read by people. It needs to be fast, clear, trustworthy and built to convert. You will work across Campaigns, Design, Development, Analytics, Product Marketing and Sales, collaborating with each to earn trust with senior stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a position based in Costa Rica.&lt;/p&gt;
